{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id817705725"}, "name":{"label":"WowzersBowezer"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-13T11:46:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.5.2"}, "id":{"label":"14299157414"}, "title":{"label":"Please fix syncing."}, "content":{"label":"I have the yearly subscription, so this is especially frustrating. The app constantly makes me re-sync my TikTok account, and every time I have to go like, favorite, and repost a bunch of videos all over again just to get it working. I don't understand why there isn't an option to reuse my previous synced data instead of starting from scratch every time.\nOn top of that, the syncing is unreliable. It often doesn't recognize new videos I've liked, favorited, or reposted, so the game doesn't work properly. The app is fun when it works, but the syncing issues make it really annoying to use especially for paying users. Please improve this.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6742410648&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
